{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16888","headline":"秋日对酒 · 武元衡","name":"秋日对酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行年过始衰，秋至独先悲。\n事往怜神魄，感深滋涕洟。\n百忧纷在虑，一醉兀无思。\n宝瑟拂麈匣，徽音凝朱丝。\n幽圃蕙兰气，烟窗松桂姿。\n我乏济时略，杖节抚藩维。\n山川大兵後，牢落空城池。\n惊沙犹振野，绿草生荒陂。\n物变风雨顺，人怀天地慈。\n春耕事秋战，戎马去封陲。\n波澜暗超忽，坚白亦磷缁。\n客有自嵩颍，重徵栖隐期。\n丹诀学仙晚，白云归谷迟。\n君恩不可报，霜露绕南枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16888.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16888","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}